# Cloudflare Pages Build Configuration
# Build command: pnpm install && pnpm --filter @redbyte/manual-site build
# Build output directory: apps/manual-site/dist
# Root directory: /

# This deploys the showcase/documentation site (manual-site), NOT the OS (playground)
# To deploy the OS instead, use: apps/playground/dist with build command: pnpm install && pnpm --filter @redbyte/playground build
